<div class="article-title"><h1 class="content-title">Treatment Patterns and Outcomes in Elderly Patients with Metastatic Breast Cancer: A Multicenter Retrospective Study
</h1></div>
<div class="article-contrib">
<span class="capture-id">Jin Hyun Park,<sup></sup></span>
